{"speciesId":395,"names":{"fr":"Pingoléon","es":"Empoleon","en":"Empoleon","ja":"エンペルト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It swims as fast as a jet boat. The edges of its wings are sharp and can slice apart drifting ice."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It avoids unnecessary disputes, but it will decimate anything that threatens its pride."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It avoids unnecessary disputes, but it will decimate anything that threatens its pride."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"S’il voit son honneur bafoué, il est capable de faire des ravages avec ses ailes tranchantes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"S’il voit son honneur bafoué, il est capable de faire des ravages avec ses ailes tranchantes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il nage aussi vite qu’un hors-bord. Le tranchant de ses ailes peut fendre un bloc de glace à la dérive."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Nada tan rápido como un fueraborda. Con los afilados bordes de sus alas puede cortar el hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"x",